# Applies only to builds whose context is the repository root — currently just
# docker/docs. Every other service sets a narrower context and is unaffected.
#
# Whitelist rather than blacklist: the docs image needs exactly two paths, and
# the root otherwise contains .git and workflows/.venv, which together make the
# build context enormous.
*
!docs/
!mkdocs.yml
# The license page includes this file via a snippet. Without it here the build
# succeeds locally and fails inside Docker.
!LICENSE
